<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR slips to 12.11pct from 12.13pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR slips to 12.11pct from 12.13pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>ATHENS, Feb 5 Reuter) - The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month dropped to 12.11 percent from 12.13 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) eased to 11.62 percent from 11.64 percent.</p>
